 refractive surgery</article-title><source>Curr Opin Ophthalmol</source><year>2003</year><volume>14</volume><fpage>44</fpage><lpage>53</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12544810</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B13"><label>13</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Holladay</surname><given-names>JT</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Consultations in refractive surgery</article-title><source>Refract Corneal Surg</source><year>1989</year><volume>5</volume><fpage>203</fpage></element-citation></ref><ref id="B14"><label>14</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Feiz</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Mannis</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Garcia-Ferrer</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Intraocular lens power calculation after laser in situ keratomileusis for myopia and hyperopia: a standardized approach</article-title><source>Cornea</source><year>2001</year><volume>20</volume><fpage>792</fpage><lpage>797</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11685053</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B15"><label>15</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Walter</surname><given-names>KA</given-names></name><name><surname>Gagnon</surname><given-names>MR</given-names></name><name><surname>Hoopes</surname><given-names>PC</given-names><suffix>Jr</suffix></name><name><surname>Dickinson</surname><given-names>PJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Accurate intraocular lens power calculation after myopic laser in situ keratomileusis, bypassing corneal power</article-title><source>J Cataract Refract Surg</source><year>2006</year><volume>32</volume><fpage>425</fpage><lpage>429</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16631050</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref i